    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "### Describe your issue\n\nOn 2026-11-24 Anaconda.org had a security issue that resulted in them revoking all API tokens to anaconda.org (see https://anaconda.statuspage.io/incidents/6fqzcml2vmlx). As a result, a new API token (with permissions described in https://scientific-python.org/specs/spec-0004/#process-for-adding-new-projects) will be needed to continue uploading wheels to the [scientific-python-nightly-wheels channel](https://anaconda.org/scientific-python-nightly-wheels).\n\n![image](https://github.com/scientific-python/upload-nightly-action/assets/5142394/697ce89f-4a51-43d0-a26f-2493f4bdce34)\n \nIf you have additional questions, please ask on https://github.com/scientific-python/upload-nightly-action/issues/195.\n\ncc @da-woods",
    "closed_at": null,
    "closed_by": null,
